        "message": "Keep sidebar disclosures consistent and readable on narrow touch layouts\n\nReuse the existing semantic components across trusted tabs and remove conflicting header and body styles. Preserve runtime behavior and record incomplete native acceptance honestly.\n\nConstraint: Main only; preserve parallel runtime edits and the daily development extension identity\nRejected: Per-tab summary overrides and a Tailwind migration | Existing tokens and components already define the required contract\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: narrow\nDirective: Static markup Chrome evidence must not be promoted to installed extension or 95+ acceptance\nTested: 81 targeted Node cases; 162 R21 integration cases; 292 static Chrome geometry samples and 3 keyboard cases; syntax check\nNot-tested: Complete final native width and zoom matrix; final full build blocked by another output owner; full working-tree suite retains 23 independent failures",
